; A posting with a cost and no units takes its units currency from its
; account's inventory when that holds one, and its units number is
; interpolated, as in beancount.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Stock
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash

2020-01-02 * "buy"
  Assets:Stock  10 HOOL {5 USD}
  Assets:Cash

2020-01-03 * "sell with missing units"
  Assets:Stock  {5 USD}
  Assets:Cash  20 USD
